        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How well do you know your Capital Cities?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you name the capital city of every country in the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capital Cities Trivia has never been so much fun. Challenge yourself in Single Player, or host a trivia night with friends and family in Party Mode! Choose from popular geography categories including Europe, North America, The 50 States, and World Capitals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capital Cities Trivia Includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All 7 continents of the world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All 195 countries in the world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All 50 U.S. states</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All 13 Canadian provinces and territories</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All 31 states of Mexico</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Mode (up to 4 players)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for group trivia nights</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick, pick-up-and-play sessions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Family-friendly trivia for all ages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad support</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So what are you waiting for? Download it now and get your brain ready for Capital Cities Trivia!</strong></p>",
